# board frontend (Vite) config.

# Auto-refresh: how often (ms) an open tab re-pulls its data on its own (#375),
# so the "Synced" clock tracks real freshness instead of drifting to hours.
# Blank → 120000 (2 min). This is a soft refetch against the server's stale-
# while-revalidate caches (it respects the source TTLs, no GitHub storm). Set to
# 0 to disable the periodic poll — the refetch-on-tab-focus stays either way.
VITE_AUTO_REFRESH_MS=
